\section platformrte_docs_templates_01_SAFETY_PLAN_5_coding_standards 5. Coding Standards

\subsection platformrte_docs_templates_01_SAFETY_PLAN_51_language_standard 5.1 Language & Standard
- **Language:** C99 (C11 compatible)
- **Standard:** MISRA C:2012 Mandatory & Required rules
- **Exceptions:** [Document any deviations and rationale]

\subsection platformrte_docs_templates_01_SAFETY_PLAN_52_key_constraints 5.2 Key Constraints
✓ No dynamic memory allocation (malloc/free banned)  
✓ Explicit error handling (no exceptions)  
✓ Checked type conversions (no bare casts)  
✓ Bounded operations (no strcpy, sprintf)  
✓ No recursion  
✓ Pointer validation required  

\subsection platformrte_docs_templates_01_SAFETY_PLAN_53_rteframework_baseline 5.3 RteFramework Baseline
- **Version:** 0.1.0
- **Usage:** OS Abstraction Layer (OAL)
- **Verification:** Per SAFETY_APPLICATION_CONDITIONS.dox
- **Modifications:** [List any modifications to RteFramework code]

